helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153089				0	zh-TW	\<link href=\"text/shared/main0650.xhp\" name=\"Java 平台支援\"\>Java 平台支援\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	zh-TW	$[officename] 支援執行基於 JavaBeans 架構的應用程式和元件的 Java 平台。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3154751				0	zh-TW	$[officename] 要支援 Java 平台，就必須安裝 Java 2 執行階段環境軟體。在安裝 $[officename] 時，系統會自動讓您選擇是否要安裝尚未安裝的檔案。必要時，您也可以立即安裝這些檔案。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155338				0	zh-TW	您需要在 $[officename] 下啟動 Java 平台支援以執行 Java 應用程式。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3155892				0	zh-TW	藉由選擇 \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>[%PRODUCTNAME] - [喜好設定]\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>[工具] - [選項]\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/java.xhp\" name=\"[$[officename]] - [Java]\"\>[$[officename]] - [Java]\</link\>\</emph\> 啟用 Java 平台支援。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id9116183				0	zh-TW	Before you can use a JDBC driver, you need to add its class path. Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Java, and click the Class Path button. After you add the path information, restart %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0650.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	zh-TW	Your modifications at the \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Java\</emph\> tab page will be used even if the Java Virtual Machine (JVM, a virtual machine for the Java platform) already has been started. After modifications to the ClassPath you must restart $[officename]. The same is true for modifications under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</emph\>. Only the two boxes "HTTP Proxy" and "FTP Proxy" and their ports don't require a restart, they will be evaluated when you click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
