helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	zh-TW	CBool (Expression1 {= | <> | < | > | <= | >=} Expression2) or CBool (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156152				0	zh-TW	傳回值類型：				20200411 15:09:53
