helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149140				0	zh-TW	\<variable id=\"hintergrundfarbetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click to open a toolbar where you can click a background color for a paragraph. The color is applied to the background of the current paragraph or the selected paragraphs.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147276				0	zh-TW	\<image id=\"img_id3148538\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_backgroundcolor.png\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148538\"\>圖示\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
