helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155934				0	zh-TW	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/03120000.xhp\" name=\"縮小段落間隔\"\>縮小段落間隔\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147143	2			0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ParaspaceDecrease\"\>按一下 \<emph\>[縮小段落間隔]\</emph\> 圖示可縮小選取段落上方的段落間隔。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	zh-TW	\<image id=\"img_id3147834\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_paraspacedecrease.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147834\"\>圖示\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145211				0	zh-TW	縮小段落間隔				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\03120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	zh-TW	您可以選取 \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\" name=\"[格式] - [段落] - [縮排和間隔]\"\>\<emph\>[格式] - [段落] - [縮排和間隔]\</emph\>\</link\> 另行調整間隔。				20200411 15:09:53
