helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153683				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"DBACCESS_PUSHBUTTON_DLG_JOIN_TABADD_PB_ADDTABLE\"\>插入目前選取的表格。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\14020100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153527				0	zh-TW	關閉				20200411 15:09:53
