helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	zh-TW	\<variable id=\"kontroll\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ControlProperties\"\>開啟用於編輯所選控制項之特性的對話方塊。\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157910	17			0	zh-TW	\<variable id=\"hinweis\"\>只有在處於設計模式並選取某個控制項後，才能呼叫 \<emph\>[特性]\</emph\> 對話方塊。\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153760				0	zh-TW	如果您在\<emph\>[屬性]\</emph\>對話方塊中輸入資料，請注意，某些下拉式組合方塊中可以進行多行輸入。而且對於可以輸入 SQL 陳述式的所有欄位以及文字方塊或標籤欄位的屬性，均可進行多行輸入。您可以開啟這些欄位，並在開啟的清單中輸入文字。下列組合鍵有效：				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148686				0	zh-TW	\<emph\>按鍵\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155390				0	zh-TW	\<emph\>效果\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	zh-TW	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+向下箭頭				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150944				0	zh-TW	擴展組合方塊				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153627				0	zh-TW	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+向上箭頭				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153063				0	zh-TW	關閉組合方塊				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	zh-TW	(Shift)+(Enter)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152811				0	zh-TW	插入新列。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	zh-TW	向上鍵				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	zh-TW	將游標放置到上一行。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152933				0	zh-TW	向下鍵				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	zh-TW	將游標放置到下一行中。				20200411 15:09:53
