helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156053				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_MN_ADD\"\>將所選圖形物件的副本直接插入文件中。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149038				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_MN_ADD_LINK\"\>將所選圖形插入為連結。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
