helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154522				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXDLG_GALLERY_TITLE:EDT_TITLE\"\>為所選畫廊物件指定一個標題。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\01010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149750				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_GALLERY_MN_DELETE\"\>確認後刪除所選圖形。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
