helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	zh-TW	You can customize your $[officename] to suit your needs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	zh-TW	Use \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06140000.xhp\" name=\"Tools - Customize\"\>\<emph\>Tools - Customize\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog to change toolbars, menus and other user interface items.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\configure_overview.xhp	0	help	par_id3145071				0	zh-TW	功能表列中的條目可任您自由編輯，您可以將條目刪除、加入新條目、將功能表中的條目複製或移動到另一個功能表中、將它們重新命名等。				20200411 15:09:53
