helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter.xhp	0	help	par_id6426892				0	zh-TW	\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/xsltfilter_create.xhp\"\>建立與測試 XML 篩選器\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
