helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146848				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>To print a range of pages, use a format like 3-6. To print single pages, use a format like 7;9;11. You can print a combination of page ranges and single pages, by using a format like 3-6;8;10;12.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
