helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156194				0	zh-TW	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>編號和內文之間的最少間隔 \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06050600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147574				0	zh-TW	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SW:METRICFIELD:TP_NUM_POSITION:MF_NUMDIST\"\>輸入編號符號右邊緣與文字左邊緣之間要留出的最小間隔。\</ahelp\>\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
