helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153104				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_METRICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_BORDER_MF_RIGHT\"\>輸入右邊框與選取內容之間要留出的間隔。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150495				0	zh-TW	上				20200411 15:09:53
