helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\packagemanager.xhp	0	help	par_id671712				0	zh-TW	Change to the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WIN\"\>\\ \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>/\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>program folder in your installation.				20200411 15:09:53
