helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149523				0	zh-TW	若要查詢 [是/否] 欄位，請在 dBASE 表格中使用下列語法：				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153180				0	zh-TW	\<emph\>狀況\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
