helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149954				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_LRFLOORX\"\>若要插入下方括號，請直接在 \<emph\>[指令]\</emph\> 視窗中輸入 \<emph\>lfloor<?>rfloor\</emph\>。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
