helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05040202.xhp	0	help	par_id1006200801024957				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>輸入軸線要與另一軸相交處的值。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
