helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id5749687				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>堆疊序列會顯示彼此互疊的值。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id79348				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>堆疊序列會以百分比顯示數值。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
