helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id7617114				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>開啟對話方塊以設定曲線屬性。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_type.xhp	0	help	par_id6649372				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>在 XY 散佈圖中向上排序 X 值以連接點，即使數值的順序不同亦然。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
