helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\table_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id0916200803551535				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>所選儲存格分割為多個儲存格。您會看到 [分割儲存格] 對話方塊。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
