helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148491				0	zh-TW	\<variable id=\"datapilot_createtable\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/datapilot_createtable.xhp\" name=\"Creating Pivot Tables\"\>Creating Pivot Tables\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	zh-TW	請將試算表中的資料區域與欄標題和列標題一併標示出來。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147264				0	zh-TW	Choose \<emph\>Data - Pivot Table - Create\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Select Source\</emph\> dialog appears. Choose \<emph\>Current selection\</emph\> and confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The table headings are shown as buttons in the \<emph\>Pivot Table\</emph\> dialog. Drag these buttons as required and drop them into the layout areas "Page Fields", "Column Fields", "Row Fields" and "Data Fields".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	zh-TW	將所需的按鈕拖曳至四個區域之一。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id7599414				0	zh-TW	Drag a button to the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area to create a button and a listbox on top of the generated pivot table. The listbox can be used to filter the pivot table by the contents of the selected item. You can use drag-and-drop within the generated pivot table to use another page field as a filter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	zh-TW	如果按鈕放置於 \<emph\>[資料欄位]\</emph\> 區域中，並且會給按鈕一個標籤同時顯示將用於計算資料的公式。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3146974				0	zh-TW	連按兩下 \<emph\>[資料欄位]\</emph\> 區域中的欄位之一，您可在該區域呼叫\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\" name=\"資料欄位\"\>\<emph\>[資料欄位]\</emph\>\</link\> 對話方塊。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3156286				0	zh-TW	Use the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data Field\</item\> dialog to select the calculations to be used for the data. To make a multiple selection, press the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl \</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>key while clicking the desired calculation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3150329				0	zh-TW	您可以使用滑鼠將按鈕移至區域中的不同位置以隨時變更按鈕的順序。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3153714				0	zh-TW	用滑鼠將欄位從區域中移出時，就可以將這個欄位移動到其他的位置。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3147338				0	zh-TW	如果對準\<emph\>「列」\</emph\>區域或「欄」區域按兩下，則會看見\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/12090105.xhp\" name=\"「資料欄位」\"\>「資料欄位」\</link\>對話方塊。在此可以選取是否顯示，以及應該顯示 \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> 單項計算結果的那些範圍。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_createtable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	zh-TW	Exit the Pivot Table dialog by pressing OK. A \<emph\>Filter\</emph\> button will now be inserted, or a page button for every data field that you dropped in the \<emph\>Page Fields\</emph\> area. The pivot table is inserted further down.				20200411 15:09:53
