helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3153715				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCPAGE_TABLE:BTN_FORMULAS\"\>列印儲存格中的公式而不是結果。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156385				0	zh-TW	零值				20200411 15:09:53
