helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149727	52			0	zh-TW	            \<emph\>Test\</emph\> 是可為 TRUE 或 FALSE 的任意值或表示式。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155828	53			0	zh-TW	            若邏輯測試為 TRUE，則傳回值 \<emph\>ThenValue\</emph\> (選擇性)。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811	54			0	zh-TW	            若邏輯測試為 FALSE，則傳回值 \<emph\>OtherwiseValue\</emph\> (選擇性)。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FA				0	zh-TW	            \<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>         				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149507				0	zh-TW	範例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150867	57			0	zh-TW	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=IF(A1>5;100;"too small")\</item\> 若 A1 中的值大於 5，就會在目前的儲存格中輸入值 100；否則，會輸入文字「太小」(不包括角括號)。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155954				0	zh-TW	\<bookmark_value\>NOT 函數\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155954				0	zh-TW	NOT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3153570				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NICHT\"\>補數 (反轉) 邏輯值。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147372				0	zh-TW	語法：				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3157996				0	zh-TW	NOT(LogicalValue)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148766	16			0	zh-TW	            \<emph\>LogicalValue\</emph\> 是要互補的任何數值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149884				0	zh-TW	範例				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150132	18			0	zh-TW	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=NOT(A)\</item\>。若 A=TRUE，則 NOT(A) 將評估 FALSE。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394				0	zh-TW	\<bookmark_value\>OR 函數\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394				0	zh-TW	OR				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>如果至少一個引數是 TRUE 則傳回 TRUE。\</ahelp\> 如果所有引數邏輯值均為 FALSE，此函數則傳回值 FALSE。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	zh-TW	這些引數可能是本身傳回邏輯值的邏輯表示式 (TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10)，或包含邏輯值的陣列 (A1:C3)。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3153546				0	zh-TW	當函數預期單一值，但是您輸入了儲存格範圍，則該儲存格範圍的值會與公式相同當作是位於相同的欄或列。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027				0	zh-TW	如果輸入的區域是在目前公式的欄或列以外，函數會傳回錯誤值 #VALUE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517				0	zh-TW	語法：				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468				0	zh-TW	OR(LogicalValue1; LogicalValue2 ...LogicalValue30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819	24			0	zh-TW	            \<emph\>LogicalValue1; LogicalValue2 ...LogicalValue30\</emph\> 是指要檢查的條件。所有條件可以是 TRUE 或 FALSE。若輸入範圍作為參數，函數會使用目前欄範圍或列範圍的值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228				0	zh-TW	Examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154870				0	zh-TW	即將檢查條目 12<11、13>22 與 45=45 的邏輯值。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371	27			0	zh-TW	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=OR(12<11;13>22;45=45)\</item\> 傳回 TRUE。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412	59			0	zh-TW	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=OR(FALSE;TRUE)\</item\> 傳回 TRUE。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148394K				0	zh-TW	\<bookmark_value\>XOR function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148394K				0	zh-TW	XOR				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3156060K				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_ODER\"\>Returns the exclusive "or" of arguments.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771K				0	zh-TW	The arguments are either numbers, logical expressions themselves (TRUE, 1<5, 2+3=7, B8<10) that return logical values, or arrays (A1:C3).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149027K				0	zh-TW	If the entered range is outside of the current column or row of the formula, the function returns the error value #VALUE!				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155517K				0	zh-TW	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3150468K				0	zh-TW	XOR(Value1; Value2 ...Value30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155819K				0	zh-TW	\<emph\>Value1; Value2 ...Value30\</emph\> are added modulo 2. TRUE is returned if the result of this addition is 1;FALSE is returned if the result of this addition is 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153228K				0	zh-TW	Examples:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155371K				0	zh-TW	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(12<11;13>22;10)\</item\> returns TRUE since this converts to (1+0+10) mod 2 = 0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3158412K				0	zh-TW	\<item type=\"input\"\>=XOR(FALSE;TRUE)\</item\> returns TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	tit				0	zh-TW	數學函數				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147124				0	zh-TW	\<bookmark_value\>數學函數\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>函數精靈; 數學\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>函數; 數學函數\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>三角函數\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
