helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165833				0	zh-TW	1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3165856				0	zh-TW	AVERAGE				20200411 15:09:53
