helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12040201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159400				0	zh-TW	\<variable id=\"zusaetzetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:MOREBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_SPEC_FILTER:BTN_MORE\"\>顯示其他篩選器選項。\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
