helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154418				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_DOLLARDE\"\>將以十進制分數格式給出的引用轉換為十進制數字。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146124				0	zh-TW	語法				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3150348				0	zh-TW	DOLLARDE(FractionalDollar; Fraction)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154111				0	zh-TW	\<emph\>FractionalDollar\</emph\> 是以十進制分數指定的數字。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3153695				0	zh-TW	\<emph\>Fraction\</emph\> 是用為十進位分數分母的整數。				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153884				0	zh-TW	範例				20200411 15:09:53
