helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150252				0	zh-TW	\<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05030400.xhp\" name=\"字首大寫\"\>字首大寫\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3154763				0	zh-TW	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DROPCAPS\"\>以大字型顯示段落的第一個字元，該字元可向下延續數行。此段落的行數至少必須為您在 [行] 方塊中所指定的行數。\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05030400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151388				0	zh-TW	設定				20200411 15:09:53
